Idiots like singer Kim.

1138
01:02:21.112 --> 01:02:23.364
THE WHOLE STORY OF THE MURDER OF THE CASINO BOSS

1139
01:02:23.448 --> 01:02:25.450
Jang the cormorant was a poor fisherman -

1140
01:02:25.533 --> 01:02:27.785
Heoyoung Industrial Area
In the city of destruction.

1141
01:02:27.869 --> 01:02:30.788
He took out a big loan
to buy a fishing vessel,

1142
01:02:30.872 --> 01:02:34.417
but got even worse in debt,
for he got no prey.

1143
01:02:34.500 --> 01:02:37.795
One day
he found a lot of dead fish.

1144
01:02:37.879 --> 01:02:40.089
He didn't think it was a problem -

1145
01:02:40.173 --> 01:02:44.719
and sold the fish at a great profit.

1146
01:02:44.802 --> 01:02:47.930
Around the same time
Heoyoung Mayor Four Seasons Jeon -

1147
01:02:48.014 --> 01:02:50.057
won the hosting of the World Ball tournament.

1148
01:02:50.141 --> 01:02:52.602
He announced,
that Tuhokaupunki will be rebuilt -

1149
01:02:52.685 --> 01:02:58.649
and forced the residents to move
due to poor settlement funds.

1150
01:02:58.733 --> 01:03:01.319
Jang the cormorant
and his wives objected -

1151
01:03:01.402 --> 01:03:05.031
and didn't want to move
unless they received fair compensation.

1152
01:03:05.114 --> 01:03:09.660
One night, Bong-cheon Kim rushed over
with hired thugs to the couple's home.

1153
01:03:10.244 --> 01:03:13.247
Jang the cormorant lost consciousness
in abuse.

1154
01:03:13.331 --> 01:03:17.502
Finally, he woke up confused
from a nearby landfill.

1155
01:03:17.585 --> 01:03:20.505
Seeing his wife buried beside him -

1156
01:03:20.588 --> 01:03:23.591
The cormorant tried to free him,
but passed out again.

1157
01:03:23.674 --> 01:03:25.885
The next thing he woke up from the hospital.

1158
01:03:25.968 --> 01:03:29.806
It was said there that he was almost
suffocated by landfill methane -

1159
01:03:29.889 --> 01:03:34.185
and that the wife was dead
for heavy metal poisoning.

1160
01:03:35.102 --> 01:03:38.356
She was a homeless widow,
who had lost everything.

1161
01:03:38.439 --> 01:03:40.525
He considered taking his own life.

1162
01:03:40.608 --> 01:03:43.945
Then the card shark Constable Hyeon
offered him a new life.

1163
01:03:44.028 --> 01:03:46.823
The constable had brought
to the couple's hospital.

1164
01:03:46.906 --> 01:03:51.786
The constable protected Merikrott, and his
under his guidance, Merikrot became a card shark.

1165
01:03:51.869 --> 01:03:55.998
Together they began to clear
gambling dens around the country.

1166
01:03:56.707 --> 01:03:59.627
One day Constable Hyeon -

1167
01:03:59.710 --> 01:04:01.921
left for Heoyoung
to play a high-stakes game.

1168
01:04:02.004 --> 01:04:04.632
He was brutally murdered.

1169
01:04:05.258 --> 01:04:09.095
The suspected killer was Bong-cheon Kim,

1170
01:04:09.178 --> 01:04:12.306
an ex-criminal who had risen
to become the boss of the gambling world.

1171
01:04:12.390 --> 01:04:16.811
Jang the cormorant read
from Constable Hyeon's notebook,

1172
01:04:16.894 --> 01:04:21.566
that he had studied the Four Seasons Jeon
and Bong-cheon Kim's corruption.

1173
01:04:21.649 --> 01:04:23.526
The cormorant became enraged when he realized,

1174
01:04:23.609 --> 01:04:27.405
that Bong-cheon had deprived
the spirit of both wife and mentor.

1175
01:04:27.488 --> 01:04:31.492
To get revenge, he honed his card shark skills
and learned to disguise,

1176
01:04:31.576 --> 01:04:35.246
and finally Bong-cheon Kim
took him to his casino.

1177
01:04:35.329 --> 01:04:41.878
Heoyoung as Land's inner player
he waited for the perfect moment to strike.

1178
01:04:41.961 --> 01:04:45.631
While in Heoyoung Land
he ran into Chef Jang.

1179
01:04:45.715 --> 01:04:48.676
Remembering the past
he read his wife's medical record -

1180
01:04:48.759 --> 01:04:52.513
and noticed that the Chef had been
wife's former doctor.

1181
01:04:52.597 --> 01:04:54.807
It was mentioned in the medical report
just a cold

1182
01:04:54.891 --> 01:04:58.644
even though it was in the blood
high concentration of heavy metals.

1183
01:04:58.728 --> 01:05:01.689
His wife
had been exposed to heavy metals -

1184
01:05:01.772 --> 01:05:04.859
long before him
was buried in a landfill.

1185
01:05:04.942 --> 01:05:07.236
Then Jang the Sea Grouse remembered the message,

1186
01:05:07.320 --> 01:05:10.323
which he had read
in Constable Hyeon's notebook.

1187
01:05:10.406 --> 01:05:15.703
He believed that the answers would be found
from the city hall archive,

1188
01:05:15.786 --> 01:05:19.582
so he went as Bong-cheon's assistant
to meet Mayor Jeon -

1189
01:05:19.665 --> 01:05:21.167
To Heoyoung City Hall.

1190
01:05:21.250 --> 01:05:24.086
With his crooked hands he stole
civil servant's identity card,

1191
01:05:24.170 --> 01:05:30.468
sneaked into the archives and found Heoyoung
the environmental report prepared by the city.

1192
01:05:30.551 --> 01:05:36.140
He studied the report, and the shocking truth
revealed to him at last.

1193
01:05:36.766 --> 01:05:39.185
Heoyoung's former mayor
Four Season Jeon -

1194
01:05:39.268 --> 01:05:42.688
had built a landfill in Tuhokaupunki
regardless of prohibitions -

